<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 13.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 13.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Tuesday, May 13:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,500.70 (1,500.10)	CHF  1,050.70 (1,054.00)</p>
<p>    DEM    887.04 (888.42)	  GBP  2,427.20 (2,436.30)</p>
<p>    ATS    126.00 (126.24)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $36.49 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$27.74 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $64.23 million ($32.47 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
